There is no requirement that a PWA do this. True is "To create a programmable content cache, a progressive web app would need to use a service worker." But Gemini parrots the false original.&lt;p&gt;I suspect the reason the false original persists as authoritative is the human understanding that subconciously translates it to the true version, theteby tolerating it. If queried, they would acknowledge the original is false. The bot has no such understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
